# ICAcademy — Complete Course Academy Workflow Specification

The goal is to build a complete, professional learning system inside ICAcademy where an administrator can create a course, organize it into modules and lessons, decide which content is free or paid, publish it, and let students learn through a structured course player.

The entire feature should work as one connected system—not just a course page or a collection of videos.

